<%- include('../partials/header') %><section class="page-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">TRAINING ADMINISTRATION</div><h1>Training reminders</h1><p>Deliver reminders to the member’s shared website and phone inbox.</p></div><a class="btn secondary" href="/lms/admin">Course builder</a></section><% if(result){ %><p role="status"><%= result %></p><% } %><div class="grid two"><section class="panel"><h2>Reminder timing</h2><form method="post" action="/lms/admin/reminders"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><label class="checkbox-label"><input type="checkbox" name="enabled" value="1" <%= config.enabled?'checked':'' %>><span>Enable training reminders</span></label><label><span>Unfinished training interval (days)</span><input type="number" name="training_interval_days" min="1" max="365" required value="<%= config.training_interval_days %>"></label><p class="muted">Starts after this many days from enrollment. Completed courses, unpublished courses and inactive accounts are excluded.</p><label><span>Certification reminder days before expiry</span><input name="certification_days" required value="<%= config.certification_days.join(', ') %>"></label><p class="muted">Up to six comma-separated thresholds. One reminder per threshold and one after expiry. Renewing a certification starts a new reminder cycle.</p><button class="btn">Save settings</button></form></section><section class="panel"><h2>Check reminders</h2><p>Checks run every 15 minutes while the Node website is running. PHP hosting uses its existing cron job. Repeated checks do not create duplicate reminders.</p><form method="post" action="/lms/admin/reminders/run"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><button class="btn secondary">Check now</button></form><h3>Recent deliveries</h3><% if(!history.length){ %><p class="muted">No reminders delivered yet.</p><% } %><% history.forEach(r=>{ %><p><strong><%= r.display_name %></strong> · <%= r.kind %><br><small><%= new Date(r.sent_at).toLocaleString() %></small></p><% }) %></section></div><%- include('../partials/footer') %>
